error[E0277]: `&'static u64` can hold a reference, which is read with `Acquire` and written with `Release`
  --> tests/compile_fail/reference_swap_with_acquire.rs:14:49
   |
14 |     let _ = CONFIG.swap(Box::leak(Box::new(8)), Acquire);
   |                    ----                         ^^^^^^^ too weak for a reference
   |                    |
   |                    required by a bound introduced by this call
   |
   = help: the trait `HoldsNoReference` is not implemented for `&'static u64`
   = note: a thread that reads a reference with `Acquire` sees the writes that made what it points to, which the `Release` that wrote it publishes
help: the trait `RmwOrdering<T>` is conditionally implemented for `atomix_core::ordering::Acquire`
