   | ^^^^^^^^----------------^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |         |
   |         unsatisfied requirement introduced here: `_: HoldsNoReference`
   = note: required for `atomix_core::ordering::Acquire` to implement `RmwOrdering<&'static u64>`
